    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nWhich diuretics are Sulfa drugs?\n\n(1) Acetazolamide\n(2) Loop diuretics\n\n(3) Thiazide diuretics\n\n(Note: Ethacrynic acid is a loop diuretic but NOT a Sulfa drug)\n\n[Image: 43b98f3112987bdfd6a905c0a5912998579d87a522998c4c9473df4887856b08]\n\n[Image: fd24c8bf36110bc5663f5646ff211f76be28c4a5d9d6dd42dd1e83573e12a788]\n\n[Image: 6b484e2a3b0d9673474877c7979babb032160efaabf982572cab966a08664dcd]\n\n[Image: dab320a1cb8ebaa62d90a9924cf4f1d2e88196a5d6f017b0eb73a7e662345e0d]\n\n2.1 - Acetazolamide, mannitol\n[Image: c346f1e1d5cb39cc059e5bd608d36a8812b1c3b530d0e01775017287fe4fe311]\n\n[Image: 61f8a0910486f3c71a4efb2db6dbb10d3bbc0bb7fb66229bb099924aa115e650]\n\n[Image: b76e775466426f4d4e1061c1f6bca824ec6b4d679966f6f7153af8a9243e768b]",
